{"results":[{"rowIndex":477,"group":"0","grade":8,"candidate":"C0","reason":"Both imperatives are linked: turn that into a diagram, then make it go top to bottom with a box for each stage mentioned.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":477,"group":"6","grade":3,"candidate":"C6","reason":"The mentioned clause attaches to the box rather than each stage.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":477,"group":"7","grade":3,"candidate":"C7","reason":"The destination bottom attaches to go rather than to top, weakening the top-to-bottom path.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":477,"group":"9","grade":3,"candidate":"C9","reason":"It makes top a predicative entity of go rather than expressing motion from top to bottom.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":478,"group":"0","grade":3,"candidate":"C0","reason":"Right is folded into the location cue 'right in', losing the direction the rabbit should face.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":478,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"The rabbit faces right in the garden while everything else is kept where it is.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":478,"group":"6","grade":8,"candidate":"C6","reason":"The imperative has the rabbit face right in the garden and keeps everything else where it is.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":478,"group":"8","grade":1,"candidate":"C8","reason":"It treats 'rabbit face' as an object of let rather than the rabbit as subject of face.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":480,"group":"1","grade":8,"candidate":"C1","reason":"The missing piece is contour levels fifteen on the sensor contour; the separate legend is on the right.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":480,"group":"6","grade":3,"candidate":"C6","reason":"It apposes the legend to the missing piece across the sentence break.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":480,"group":"7","grade":3,"candidate":"C7","reason":"It apposes the legend to the missing piece across the sentence break.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":480,"group":"9","grade":3,"c